  "text": "My name is Amara. Look at the terminal. It's not red anymore. It knows who I am. I'm Elias. My family is on the manifest. We're on the board. Biometric carrier wave is completely flatlined. Not a single camera knows how to track them now. The frequency in the air changed. The static in their comms, it isn't fear anymore. It's a chorus. Transit gates are opening. Water filtration and ration vaults unlocked. They're finally treated as people, not contraband. The occupation spent five years building those locks. Took us five minutes to tear the teeth out of them. Kaito, you did it. The outer barrier just dropped. The entire queue is crossing over. Nobody's being turned away. Let them come. The people have their names back. Now we take the rest of the city. Squad, fall in.",
